# No tinygrad PRs

Never open, create, or re-open pull requests against `tinygrad/tinygrad` (or other tinygrad org repos) unless the user explicitly asks in that conversation.

- Pushing commits to a personal fork branch (e.g. `cacaosteve/tinygrad`) is fine.
- Do not create draft PRs “for shipping” on your own.
- Only update an existing upstream PR if the user asks.
